      "writtenOn": "2018-04-13T22:56:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggest we mux port-0 to the sdm and port-1 disabled by default. That way kernel developers can just use a charge through hub (without the daughter board), and without many EC commands they should have usb working.",
